  "title": "The Complete Guide to Lien Waivers: Types, Purposes, and Best Practices",
  "summary": "A lien waiver is a legal document in construction projects where contractors and vendors agree they won't place a lien against a property after receiving payment. These documents must be filled out precisely with specific information, which is why many use construction finance software to simplify the process.",
